    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "the beautiful, quiet relief... that's a weird way to put it. but i get what you mean. everything is just so loud and heavy. it’s like i’m exhausted from just trying to be a person. do you really think that's the only honest response? that just... letting go is better than fighting the noise?",
